Workmeter runtime patch for DynamoRIO 11.3.0-1.
Base source commit: 6847bb210bea0ca11d1bf47704383d6a075da490
Upstream copyright notices and BSD terms: LICENSE.DynamoRIO in this directory.
Only a returning vfork parent may reclaim its own completed child's context.
Restore interrupted syscalls before pending signal delivery can resume the app.
Backport decoder initialization fix from upstream commit c46d736f308e6e734bd0477f7b8a2dcbefb155d3.
Upstream PR: https://github.com/DynamoRIO/dynamorio/pull/7321

